OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F313A1783684157
OL,3,CCan a red card be overturned, and who
OL,4,Creally has the final say?
OL,6,FWords by ITV News Producer, Jamel Smith
OL,8,FThe football world has been left
OL,9,Fquestioning the rules of the game
OL,10,Fafter a red card suspension for an
OL,11,FAmerican striker was overturned by
OL,12,FFifa following an intervention by
OL,13,FDonald Trump.
OL,15,FAmerican striker Folarin Balogun was
OL,16,Fsent off during the USA's last-32
OL,17,Fmatch against Bosnia and Herzegovina
OL,18,Fon July 2, which normally would have
OL,19,Ftriggered an automatic one-match
OL,20,Fsuspension for the following game.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G1/17
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext Page BNat Sport CNat Radio FRewind
FL,314,300,200,120,000,100
PN,31302
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F313A1783684157
OL,3,CCan a red card be overturned, and who
OL,4,Creally has the final say?
OL,6,FFifa confirmed there was no way to
OL,7,Fappeal, and the case was closed. Or so
OL,8,Feveryone thought.
OL,10,FOn July 5, Fifa announced that
OL,11,FBalogun's suspension was overturned
OL,12,Fand that he was therefore allowed to
OL,13,Fplay in the USA's next match against
OL,14,FBelgium - a decision quickly applauded
OL,15,Fby the US president on Truth Social.
OL,17,FAmid public criticisms that Fifa had
OL,18,F"crossed a red line", questions were
OL,19,Fraised about whether the decision came
OL,20,Ffrom a phone call between Trump and
OL,21,FFifa president Gianni Infantino.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G2/17
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext Page BNat Sport CNat Radio FRewind
FL,314,300,200,120,000,100
PN,31303
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F313A1783684157
OL,3,CCan a red card be overturned, and who
OL,4,Creally has the final say?
OL,6,FThen, in a stunning turn of events,
OL,7,FTrump confirmed during a press
OL,8,Fconference on Monday that he had asked
OL,9,FInfantino to review the decision
OL,10,Fbecause he believed the challenge
OL,11,F"wasn't a foul".
OL,13,FTrump said he had "only" asked for the
OL,14,Fincident to be reviewed and denied
OL,15,Ftelling Fifa to overturn Balogun's ban.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G3/17
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext Page BNat Sport CNat Radio FRewind
FL,314,300,200,120,000,100
PN,31304
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F313A1783684157
OL,3,CCan a red card be overturned, and who
OL,4,Creally has the final say?
OL,6,FHe added: "I think it (the suspension)
OL,7,Fwould have left a big stain. I can't
OL,8,Ftell them what to do. I don't believe
OL,9,Fthey made the decision; I believe it
OL,10,Fwas the commission that made the
OL,11,Fdecision. And it was the right
OL,12,Fdecision."
OL,14,FBut it didn't do the World Cup co-
OL,15,Fhosts much good, as they crashed out 4-
OL,16,F1 to Belgium on Monday night, with
OL,17,Fmany fans blaming Trump for getting
OL,18,Fpolitics involved.
OL,26,@nD@WpmnD@fpn
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G4/17
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext Page BNat Sport CNat Radio FRewind
FL,314,300,200,120,000,100
PN,31305
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F313A1783684157
OL,3,CCan a red card be overturned, and who
OL,4,Creally has the final say?
OL,6,FStill, the reversal has left the
OL,7,Ffootball world asking whether the
OL,8,Frules mean anything.
OL,10,FSo how can a red card be challenged,
OL,11,Fand why was Balogun's suspension
OL,12,Foverturned?
OL,14,FCan you appeal a red card?
OL,16,FThe short answer is you can't, not
OL,17,Freally.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G5/17
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext Page BNat Sport CNat Radio FRewind
FL,314,300,200,120,000,100
PN,31306
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F313A1783684157
OL,3,CCan a red card be overturned, and who
OL,4,Creally has the final say?
OL,6,FUnder FIFA's disciplinary rules,
OL,7,Fdecisions made by the referee during a
OL,8,Fmatch are considered final and cannot
OL,9,Fbe overturned through an appeal.
OL,11,FIf a referee decides a tackle is
OL,12,Fworthy of a red card, that decision
OL,13,Fwill remain, even if later replays
OL,14,Fsuggest the call was incorrect.
OL,16,FThere's one narrow exception: if there
OL,17,Fhas been an obvious error, such as the
OL,18,Fwrong player being sent off.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G6/17
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext Page BNat Sport CNat Radio FRewind
FL,314,300,200,120,000,100
PN,31307
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F313A1783684157
OL,3,CCan a red card be overturned, and who
OL,4,Creally has the final say?
OL,6,FIn those cases, the punishment can be
OL,7,Ftransferred to the correct player, but
OL,8,Fthe referee's decision itself is not
OL,9,Freversed.
OL,11,FStill, teams can submit a formal
OL,12,Fprotest within 24 hours of the final
OL,13,Fwhistle, with a fee of around #900,
OL,14,Fbut again, only for a narrow category
OL,15,Fof obvious mistakes.
OL,17,FA referee's judgment over a tackle
OL,18,Fdoes not qualify. But what a team can
OL,19,Fchallenge is any additional punishment
OL,20,Fimposed on top of the automatic one-
OL,21,Fmatch ban.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G7/17
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext Page BNat Sport CNat Radio FRewind
FL,314,300,200,120,000,100
PN,31308
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F313A1783684157
OL,3,CCan a red card be overturned, and who
OL,4,Creally has the final say?
OL,6,FFor example, if Fifa adds on further
OL,7,Fmatch bans for serious foul play, a
OL,8,Fteam can appeal that extra punishment.
OL,10,FSo how was Balogun's ban overturned?
OL,12,FAfter Trump's call, Fifa's
OL,13,FDisciplinary Committee used a little-
OL,14,Fknown rule called Article 27 of its
OL,15,Fdisciplinary code, a rule that allows
OL,16,Fa punishment to be suspended for a
OL,17,Fprobationary period.
OL,19,FArticle 27 can be applied to any red
OL,20,Fcard, but this has never happened
OL,21,Fbefore.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G8/17
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext Page BNat Sport CNat Radio FRewind
FL,314,300,200,120,000,100
PN,31309
SC,0009
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F313A1783684157
OL,3,CCan a red card be overturned, and who
OL,4,Creally has the final say?
OL,6,FIn Balogun's case, the one-match
OL,7,Fsuspension was placed on hold for one
OL,8,Fyear.
OL,10,FThis means that the ban was not
OL,11,Fremoved entirely - it was effectively
OL,12,Ffrozen. If he commits a similar
OL,13,Foffence during that period, the
OL,14,Fpunishment could be reactivated.
OL,16,FCrucially, this was not an appeal, as
OL,17,Fthere is no route to appeal a
OL,18,Freferee's decision in this situation.
OL,20,FInstead, Fifa chose to press pause on
OL,21,Fits own punishment.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G9/17
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext Page BNat Sport CNat Radio FRewind
FL,314,300,200,120,000,100
PN,31310
SC,0010
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F313A1783684157
OL,3,CCan a red card be overturned, and who
OL,4,Creally has the final say?
OL,6,FThe rule has never been used at a
OL,7,FWorld Cup until now, adding to the
OL,8,Fcontroversy surrounding the decision.
OL,10,FWhy did Fifa intervene?
OL,12,FFifa offered no public explanation for
OL,13,Ffreezing the ban.
OL,15,FWhat we do know is that Trump phoned
OL,16,FInfantino about the decision, and days
OL,17,Flater, Balogun was cleared to play.
OL,19,FWhat has the reaction been?
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                   G10/17
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext Page BNat Sport CNat Radio FRewind
FL,314,300,200,120,000,100
PN,31311
SC,0011
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F313A1783684157
OL,3,CCan a red card be overturned, and who
OL,4,Creally has the final say?
OL,6,FThe response has been highly critical
OL,7,Ffrom the very top of the game.
OL,9,FUefa issued an unusually strong
OL,10,Fstatement, saying the decision
OL,11,F"crossed a red line", and describing
OL,12,Fit as "unprecedented, incomprehensible
OL,13,Fand unjustifiable".
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                   G11/17
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext Page BNat Sport CNat Radio FRewind
FL,314,300,200,120,000,100
PN,31312
SC,0012
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F313A1783684157
OL,3,CCan a red card be overturned, and who
OL,4,Creally has the final say?
OL,6,FEuropean football's governing body
OL,7,Fargued that automatic suspensions
OL,8,Ffollowing red cards are part of
OL,9,Ffootball's rules and warned that
OL,10,Fcreating an exception during a
OL,11,Ftournament for the co-host could
OL,12,Fundermine confidence in the
OL,13,Fcompetition.
OL,15,FUefa also warned that the decision
OL,16,Fcreates a precedent, as every player
OL,17,Fin the same situation now has a claim
OL,18,Fto argue they should receive the same
OL,19,Ftreatment as Balogun.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                   G12/17
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext Page BNat Sport CNat Radio FRewind
FL,314,300,200,120,000,100
PN,31313
SC,0013
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F313A1783684157
OL,3,CCan a red card be overturned, and who
OL,4,Creally has the final say?
OL,6,FThat has also raised questions for
OL,7,FEngland.
OL,9,FThe FA is considering whether to
OL,10,Fchallenge Jarell Quansah's red car
OL,11,Fduring the Mexico game, while reports
OL,12,Fsuggest France is also exploring
OL,13,Fwhether to appeal Michael Olise's
OL,14,Fyellow card following their victory
OL,15,Fover Paraguay.
OL,17,FIn a staunch rebuke, former Liverpool
OL,18,FFC manager Jurgen Klopp told The
OL,19,FTelegraph: "This is our sport, not
OL,20,Ftheirs.
OL,26,@zD@Mxz{D@LOU
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                   G13/17
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext Page BNat Sport CNat Radio FRewind
FL,314,300,200,120,000,100
PN,31314
SC,0014
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F313A1783684157
OL,3,CCan a red card be overturned, and who
OL,4,Creally has the final say?
OL,6,F"If Donald Trump and Gianni Infantino
OL,7,Freally sorted this out between
OL,8,Fthemselves, it is madness; it calls
OL,9,Feverything into question."
OL,11,FEngland boss Thomas Tuchel captured
OL,12,Fthe confusion after the Mexico game.
OL,14,FHe said: "Where does this start and
OL,15,Fwhere does this end now? Can we
OL,16,Foverturn it or not overturn it? What's
OL,17,Fgoing on?"
OL,26,@nD@AOUqD@ZO]
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                   G14/17
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext Page BNat Sport CNat Radio FRewind
FL,314,300,200,120,000,100
PN,31315
SC,0015
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F313A1783684157
OL,3,CCan a red card be overturned, and who
OL,4,Creally has the final say?
OL,6,FSubscribe for free to our weekly
OL,7,Fnewsletter for exclusive and original
OL,8,Fcoverage from ITV News. Direct to your
OL,9,Finbox every Friday morning.
OL,11,FWho has the final say?
OL,13,FThe final decision rests with Fifa's
OL,14,FDisciplinary Committee.
OL,16,FIt has the power to impose, adjust, or
OL,17,Fsuspend punishments under Fifa's
OL,18,Fdisciplinary regulations.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                   G15/17
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext Page BNat Sport CNat Radio FRewind
FL,314,300,200,120,000,100
PN,31316
SC,0016
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F313A1783684157
OL,3,CCan a red card be overturned, and who
OL,4,Creally has the final say?
OL,6,FAs Balogun's case showed, it also
OL,7,Fholds the power to enact Article 27 to
OL,8,Ffreeze punishments entirely.
OL,10,FAbove it sits Fifa's Appeal Committee,
OL,11,Fand beyond that the Court of
OL,12,FArbitration for Sport (CAS), which has
OL,13,Fa fast-track division on site at this
OL,14,FWorld Cup.
OL,16,FIn theory, a team could take a case to
OL,17,FCAS, but the court has historically
OL,18,Frefused to second-guess refereeing
OL,19,Fdecisions.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                   G16/17
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext Page BNat Sport CNat Radio FRewind
FL,314,300,200,120,000,100
PN,31317
SC,0017
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F313A1783684157
OL,3,CCan a red card be overturned, and who
OL,4,Creally has the final say?
OL,6,FSo, the final word rests with Fifa
OL,7,Fitself. And after the Balogun affair,
OL,8,Fthat's precisely what has so many in
OL,9,Fthe game worried.
OL,11,FFrom Westminster to Washington DC -
OL,12,Four political experts are across all
OL,13,Fthe latest key talking points. Listen
OL,14,Fto the latest episode below...
